OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric private estate goes on
OL,4,Asale for #65m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mansion once home to
OL,7,Flieutenant-governors, a marmalade
OL,8,Fmagnate and family of Oscar-winning
OL,9,Factresses has been put on the market
OL,10,Ffor #65m.
OL,12,FHavilland Hall in Guernsey sits in
OL,13,Fabout 80 acres of land, has six
OL,14,Fbedrooms, seven bathrooms, five
OL,15,Freception rooms, an indoor pool and is
OL,16,Fbeing marketed as the island's largest
OL,17,Fprivate estate.
