OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric private estate goes on
OL,4,Asale for #65m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe property's nearly 200-year history
OL,7,Fincludes periods owned by marmalade
OL,8,Fbusinessman William Keiller, while
OL,9,Fdescendants of its original owner
OL,10,Fincluded Oscar-winning actresses Olivia
OL,11,Fde Havilland and Joan Fontaine.
OL,13,FEstate agents Savills said estates of
OL,14,Fthis scale were "extraordinarily rare
OL,15,Fin the Channel Islands and it is likely
OL,16,Fto draw a global audience."
